sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Resolve privately, then connect through existing routes
accDescr: The application resolves a private hosted-zone record through its VPC resolver, then connects using separately authorized private routing.
participant A as Application VPC
participant R as VPC Resolver
participant Z as Associated private zone
participant D as Database VPC
A->>R: Query database.internal.example.com
R->>Z: Match associated private zone
Z-->>R: A record: private IPv4
R-->>A: Private address
A->>D: Database connection over peering
Note over A,D: Routes and security rules checked separately
